  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "What should your enterprise modernize, and what evidence supports that choice?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 5.533141812483676,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "EMOS is the Enterprise Modernization Operating System.",
      "start": 5.533141812483676,
      "end": 9.74144685296422,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "It connects workload evidence, six R decisions, human governance, execution planning,",
      "start": 9.74144685296422,
      "end": 16.22925045703839,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "and representative outcomes.",
      "start": 16.22925045703839,
      "end": 18.235988508749017,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow Understand, Decide, Govern, Transform, and Outcomes.",
      "start": 18.235988508749017,
      "end": 23.38921389396709,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Begin with a sample estate or a sanitized portfolio.",
      "start": 23.38921389396709,
      "end": 27.70467484983024,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect Enterprise DNA, identify missing facts, and compare the recommendation with",
      "start": 27.70467484983024,
      "end": 33.39367981196134,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "alternatives before making a decision.",
      "start": 33.39367981196134,
      "end": 35.53679811961347,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask EMOS is the conversational interface.",
      "start": 35.53679811961347,
      "end": 38.800182815356486,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "A deterministic orchestrator routes reasoning to two Gemini-backed specialists:",
      "start": 38.800182815356486,
      "end": 43.95340820057456,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Portfolio Discovery and Enterprise Architect.",
      "start": 43.95340820057456,
      "end": 46.91480804387568,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Deterministic validation and governance enforce the rules.",
      "start": 46.91480804387568,
      "end": 50.11000261164794,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "The orchestrator is not a third agent.",
      "start": 50.11000261164794,
      "end": 52.623295899712716,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Evidence readiness never grants approval.",
      "start": 52.623295899712716,
      "end": 55.360642465395664,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "A human must explicitly approve governed progression.",
      "start": 55.360642465395664,
      "end": 59.637137633846955,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Transform tracks disposition-specific workflows;",
      "start": 59.637137633846955,
      "end": 62.96871245756071,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "it does not perform live cloud migrations.",
      "start": 62.96871245756071,
      "end": 66.02752676939149,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure and Learn show representative benchmarks and session-only notes.",
      "start": 66.02752676939149,
      "end": 71.08333768607991,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, choose an estate and inspect one workload.",
      "start": 71.08333768607991,
      "end": 74.597146,
      "chapter": 3
    }
  ],
